[{"title":"长信宫词","author":"陆游","text":"忆年十七兮初入未央，获侍步辇兮恭承宠光。\n地寒祚薄兮自贻不祥，谗言乘之兮罪衅日彰。\n祸来嵯峨兮势如壤墙，当伏重诛兮鼎耳剑铓。\n长信虽远兮匪弃路旁，岁给絮帛兮月赐稻粱。\n君举玉食兮犀箸谁尝，君御朝衣兮谁进熏香。\n婕妤才人兮俨其分行，千秋万岁兮永奉君王。\n妾虽益衰兮尚供蚕桑，愿置茧馆兮组织玄黄。\n欲诉不得兮仰呼苍苍，佩服忠贞兮之死敢忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":1,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"陆游","text":"厚味无人设佞汤，微芬时自炷廉香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"陆游","text":"使君何所乐，乐在南湖滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"陆游","text":"是邦山水窟，领会得佳处。\n山回如可招，水集若来赴。\n竹叶溯江船，春荠隔烟树。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":4,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"陆游","text":"秃老本儒冠，荆公使为僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":5,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"陆游","text":"但见古河东，荞麦铺如雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琴调相思令•思归词","author":"赵鼎","text":"归去来，归去来。\n昨夜东风吹梦回，家山安在哉。\n酒一杯，复一杯。\n准拟愁怀待酒开，愁多肠九回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思","author":" 贺怜怜","text":"朝相思。\n暮相思。\n朝暮相思无尽时。\n奉君断肠词。\n生相思。\n死相思。\n生死相思两处辞。\n何由得见之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":8,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 二月二十三日夜松轩作","author":"毛滂","text":"夜夜。\n夜了花朝也。\n连忙。\n指点银瓶索酒尝。\n明朝花落知多少。\n莫把残红扫。\n愁人。\n一片花飞减却春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":9,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花 其一","author":"徐积","text":"谁言造物无偏处，独遣春光住此中。\n叶里深藏云外碧，枝头常借日边红。\n曾陪桃李开时雨，仍伴梧桐落后风。\n费尽主人歌与酒，不教閒却卖花翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":10,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花 其二","author":"徐积","text":"一从春色入花来，便把春阳不放回。\n雪圃未容梅独占，霜篱初约菊同开。\n长生洞里神仙种，万岁楼前锦绣堆。\n过尽白驹都不管，绿杨红杏自相催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":11,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花 其三","author":"徐积","text":"一谢芳菲更不还，谁何娇步独盘桓。\n虽于物态为难有，却是时情总易阑。\n日晒香肌难避暑，雪濡粉面亦禁寒。\n等閒莫使人知处，长与诗家醉后看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花 其四","author":"徐积","text":"谁与猩猩血染红，重重叠叠费春工。\n应无暴物侵和气，自有深根藏暖风。\n每见灵芝三秀了，回看凡艳一时空。\n如环光景循将遍，又到江南梅信通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":13,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长春花 其五","author":"徐积","text":"枝上疏疏花启房，轻绡重锦迭为裳。\n更分深浅两般色，不作寻常一面妆。\n蕣有红华须斗艳，兰虽清节亦交香。\n吟翁未畅先投笔，为与东君咏海棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":14,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郑润甫提举见寄 其二","author":"戴复古","text":"长身如病鹤，吟苦如蟋蟀。\n顾此憔悴姿，痴生年八秩。\n举世皆好竽，老夫方鼓瑟。\n梅花莫笑人，茅檐炙朝日。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉吟","author":"戴复古","text":"草茅无路谒君王，白首终为田舍郎。\n近读南华资旷达，欲师西洛愧荒唐。\n乾坤万象供诗料，风月一楼为醉乡。\n日晚栖禽归自乐，飞鸣不是怨斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":16,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次王应求韵","author":"戴复古","text":"逐日轮蹄走四方，来来去去为何忙。\n无人肯问山林乐，举世争趋名利场。\n以道自脩身是宝，无求何用智为囊。\n爱梅栽竹平生语，吐出清风六月凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":17,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"张先","text":"牡丹含露真珠颗，美人折向庭前过。\n含笑问檀郎，花强妾貌强。\n檀郎故相恼，须道花枝好。\n一面发娇嗔，碎挼花打人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":18,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"撷芳词","author":"无名氏","text":"风摇荡，雨濛茸，翠条柔弱花头重。\n春衫窄，香肌湿，记得年时，共伊曾摘。\n都如梦，何曾共，可怜孤似钗头凤。\n关山隔，晚云碧，燕儿来也，又无消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈抟","text":"蚕月桑叶青，莺时柳花白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郭纶","author":"苏轼","text":"河西猛士无人识，日暮津亭阅过船。\n路人但觉骢马瘦，不知铁槊大如椽。\n因言西方久不战，截发愿作万骑先。\n我当凭轼与寓目，看君飞矢集蛮毡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":21,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早春咏雪","author":"王初","text":"句芒宫树已先开，珠蕊琼花斗剪裁。\n散作上林今夜雪，送教春色一时来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望雪","author":"王初","text":"银花珠树晓来看，宿醉初醒一倍寒。\n已似王恭披鹤氅，凭栏仍是玉栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其一","author":"王初","text":"应为阳春信未传，固将青艳属残年。\n东君欲待寻佳约，剩寄衣香与粉绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其二","author":"王初","text":"迎春雪艳飘零极，度夕蟾华掩映多。\n欲托清香传远信，一枝无计奈愁何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":25,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪霁","author":"王初","text":"星榆叶叶昼离披，云粉千重凝不飞。\n昆玉楼台珠树密，夜来谁向月中归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":26,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书秋","author":"王初","text":"千里南云度塞鸿，秋容无迹淡平空。\n人间玉岭清宵月，天上银河白昼风。\n潘赋登山魂易断，楚歌遗佩怨何穷。\n往来未若奇张翰，欲鲙霜鲸碧海东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"延平天庆观","author":"王初","text":"剑化江边绿构新，层台不染玉梯尘。\n千章隐篆标龙简，一曲空歌降凤钧。\n岚气湿衣云叶晚，天香飘户月枝春。\n盟经早晚闻仙语，学种三芝伴羽人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自和书秋","author":"王初","text":"陇首斜飞避弋鸿，颓云萧索见层空。\n汉宫夜结双茎露，阊阖凉生六幕风。\n湘女怨弦愁不禁，鄂君香被梦难穷。\n江边两桨连歌渡，惊散游鱼莲叶东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王秀才谒池州吴都督","author":"王初","text":"池阳去去跃雕鞍，十里长亭百草乾。\n衣袂障风金镂细，剑光横雪玉龙寒。\n晴郊别岸乡魂断，晓树啼乌客梦残。\n南馆星郎东道主，摇鞭休问路行难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送叶秀才","author":"王初","text":"快骑璁珑刻玉羁，河梁返照上征衣。\n层冰春近蟠龙起，九泽云闲独鹤飞。\n行想北山清梦断，重游西洛故人稀。\n汉庭狗监深知己，有日前驱负弩归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":31,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"银河","author":"王初","text":"阊阖疏云漏绛津，桥头秋夜鹊飞频。\n犹残仙媛湔裙水，几见星妃度袜尘。\n历历素榆飘玉叶，涓涓清月湿冰轮。\n年来若有乘槎客，为吊波灵是楚臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":32,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟次汴堤","author":"王初","text":"曲岸兰丛雁飞起，野客维舟碧烟里。\n竿头五两转天风，白日杨花满流水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"王岩","text":"朝宗任叠千重浪，捧日能消几片云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曹娥庙","author":"潘阆","text":"曹娥庙前秋草平，曹娥庙里秋月明。\n扁舟一夜炯无寐，近听潮声似哭声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":35,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿江浦闻元八改官寄此","author":"赵师秀","text":"君游丹陛已三迁，我泛沧浪亦二年。\n剑佩晓趋双凤阙，烟波夜宿一渔船。\n交亲尽在青云上，乡曲都抛白日边。\n若报生涯应笑杀，结茆栽芋种畬田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":36,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠回道士","author":"滕宗谅","text":"华州回道人，来到岳阳城。\n别我游何处，秋空一剑横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寂上人禅房","author":"高翥","text":"俗尘浮垢闭禅关，百岁身心几日闲。\n安得此生同草木，无营长在四时閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":38,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"占巾子","author":"叶简","text":"近来好裹束，各自竞尖新。\n称无二三两，因何号一斤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":39,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"占两鸡子","author":"叶简","text":"此物不难知，一雄兼一雌。\n请将打破看，方明混沌时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":40,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"陶谷","text":"乞与金钟病眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":41,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初发嘉州","author":"苏轼","text":"朝发鼓阗阗，西风猎画旃。\n故乡飘已远，往意浩无边。\n锦水细不见，蛮江清可怜。\n奔腾过佛脚，旷荡造平川。\n野市有禅客，钓台寻暮烟。\n相期定先到，久立水潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":42,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨徽之","text":"新霜染枫叶，皎月借芦花。\n废宅寒塘水，荒坟宿草烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁丰","author":"宋祁","text":"皇天降丰年，本忧贫士食。\n贫士无良畴，安能得稼穑。\n工佣输富家，日落长叹息。\n为供豪者粮，役尽匹夫力。\n天地莫施恩，施恩强有得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":44,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其一","author":"释延寿","text":"南有天台事可尊，孕灵含秀独超群。\n重重曲涧侵危石，步步层岩踏碎云。\n金雀每从云里现，异香多向夜深闻。\n当知此界非凡界，一道幽奇各自分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":45,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"津亭","author":"胡宿","text":"津亭欲阕戒棠舟，五两风来不暂留。\n西北浮云连魏阙，东南初日满秦楼。\n层城渺渺人伤别，芳草萋萋客倦游。\n平乐旧欢收不得，更凭飞梦到瀛洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"胡宿","text":"屏翳驱云结夜阴，素花飘坠恶氛沈。\n色欺曹国麻衣浅，寒入荆王翠被深。\n天上明河银作水，海中仙树玉为林。\n日高独拥鹴裘卧，谁乞长安取酒金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":47,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方广寺石桥","author":"赵湘","text":"白石峰犹在，桥横一径微。\n多年无客过，落日有云归。\n水净苔生发，山寒树著枝。\n如何方广寺，千古去人稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇圣寺斌公房","author":"高翥","text":"近来唯一食，树下掩禅扉。\n落日寒山磬，多年坏衲衣。\n白须长更剃，青霭远还归。\n仍说游南岳，经行是息机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":49,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其二","author":"释延寿","text":"仙源佛窟有天台，今古嘉名遍九垓。\n石磴嵌空神匠出，瀑泉雄壮雨声来。\n景强偏感高僧住，地胜能令远思开。\n一等翘诚依此处，自然灵贶作梯媒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":50,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其三","author":"释延寿","text":"智泉福海莫能逾，亲自王恩运睿谟。\n感现尽冥心境界，资持全固道根株。\n石梁低翥红鹦鹉，烟岭高翔碧鹧鸪。\n胜妙重重惟祷祝，永资军庶息灾虞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其四","author":"释延寿","text":"凌晨迎请倍精诚，亲敬鲜花异处清。\n罗汉攀枝呈梵相，岩僧倚树现真形。\n神幡双出红霞动，宝塔全开白气生。\n都为王心标意切，满空盈月瑞分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":52,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其五","author":"释延寿","text":"幡花宝盖满清川，祈祷迎来圣半千。\n莫道圣缘无影响，须知嘉会有因缘。\n空中长似闻天乐，岩畔尝疑有地仙。\n何必更寻兜率去，重重灵应事昭然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":53,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 其六","author":"释延寿","text":"登云步岭涉烟程，好景随心次第生。\n圣者已符祥瑞事，地灵全副祷祈情。\n洞深重叠拖云湿，滩浅潺湲漱水清。\n愿满事圆归去路，便风相送片帆轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"紫阁","author":"薛昌朝","text":"阁下寒溪涨碧湍，阁前苍翠数峰环。\n危梯续蹬穿松外，细竹分泉落石间。\n好鸟啁啾争唤客，乱云开合巧藏山。\n独来应为禅僧笑，少有人能伴我闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":55,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"了元","text":"鳞甲何多，羽毛无数，悟来佛性皆同。\n世人何事，刚爱口头浓。\n痛把群生割剖，刀头转、鲜血飞红。\n□□□，零炮碎炙，不忍见渠侬。\n喉咙。\n才咽罢，龙肝凤髓，毕竟无踪。\n谩赢得、生前夭寿多凶。\n奉劝世人省悟，休恣意、激恼阎翁。\n轮回转，本来面目，改换片时中。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"三学诸生","text":"庾岭梅花清似玉，一番香要一番寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":57,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百字谣/念奴娇 寿主簿二月廿一","author":"三槐","text":"武夷秀气，萃君家、春色融和时节。\n赏了花朝才六日，曾记挺生英杰。\n量吸鲸川，志吞牛渚，标格冰壶洁。\n台星明处，年年辉映南极。\n须信早晚横翔，云霄直上，宁久栖鸾棘。\n富贵荣华年正少，谢砌芝兰秀发。\n行及瓜期，荣趋花县，百里民怀德。\n交腾荐剡，褒迁大振勋业。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":58,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游麻姑","author":"上清真人","text":"攀萝蹑翠上麻姑，得到山中景物殊。\n白鹤有情来碧落，綵鸾无意下清都。\n仙媛虚见桑田变，世事谁经海水枯。\n为问方平开宴后，不知还约再来无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":59,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石庵成日偈","author":"子言庵主","text":"一击石庵全，纵然得自然。\n清凉无暑气，涓洁有甘泉。\n宽廓含沙界，寂寥绝众缘。\n个中无限义，风月一床眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"子问","text":"驱却馀寒碎土牛，田园生计又从头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":61,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李公谟壁","author":"刘卞功","text":"日转庭槐影渐移，重门复壁转呼迟。\n不如拂袖穿云去，惟有落花流水知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题僦楼壁","author":"川官","text":"朝看贝叶牢笼佛，夜礼星辰取奉天。\n呼召归来闻好语，初三初四亦欣然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":63,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"维王府园与王元规承事同赋 其二","author":"释道潜","text":"一霎催花骤雨来，集芳堂下锦千堆。\n浪红狂紫浑争发，不待商量细细开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":64,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 端午和前韵","author":"勿翁","text":"庭外潇潇雨。\n对空山、再度端阳，悄无情绪。\n旧日文君今瘦损，寻旧曲、不成腔谱。\n更不周郎回顾。\n尚喜庭萱春未老，捧蒲觞、细细歌金缕。\n儿女醉，笑还语。\n醉馀更作婆娑舞。\n又谁知、灵均心事，菊英兰露。\n最苦当年哀郢意，因甚夫君未许。\n却枉使、蛾眉见妒。\n在再章台才十载，笑关河、失报应旁午。\n愁读到，楚辞句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":65,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"太学士人","text":"莫怪钱神容易致，钱神尽是愚夫。\n为何此鬼却相于。\n只因频展义，长是泣穷途。\n韩氏有文曾饯汝，临行慎莫踌躇。\n青灯双点照平湖。\n蕉船从此逝，相共送陶朱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池鸥","author":"太学生","text":"朝来池上有斯事，火急报教同舍知。\n昨夜雨馀春水满，白鸥飞下立多时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张乖崖","author":"太学生","text":"四窗灭尽读书灯，窗外唯闻步铎声。\n辜负江山好明月，闲来此地趁虚名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"太学生妻","text":"数日相望极，须知意思迷。\n梦魂不怕险，飞过大江西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南乡子","author":"太学诸生","text":"洪迈被拘留。\n稽首垂哀告彼酋。\n七日忍饥犹不耐，堪羞。\n苏武争禁十九秋。\n厥父既无谋。\n厥子安能解国忧。\n万里归来夸舌辨，村牛。\n好摆头时便摆头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]